/T (Fine-tuning is the process of continuing the training of a pretrained transformer on a task-specific labeled dataset. The model adapts its internal representations to the target classification objective while retaining its linguistic prior. This allows strong performance even on relatively small datasets, and is the central methodology demonstrated in this project.)
/E (Fine-tuning is the process of continuing the training of a pretrained transformer on a task-specific labeled dataset. The model adapts its internal representations to the target classification objective while retaining its linguistic prior. This allows strong performance even on relatively small datasets, and is the central methodology demonstrated in this project.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
