/T (HateBERT \(GroNLP/hateBERT\) is a BERT-base model further pretrained on approximately 100 million hate-related Reddit posts from banned communities \(the RAL-E dataset\). Its domain-specific linguistic knowledge was hypothesized to give it an advantage on hate speech classification. The same WeightedTrainer configuration as RoBERTa was applied.)
/E (HateBERT \(GroNLP/hateBERT\) is a BERT-base model further pretrained on approximately 100 million hate-related Reddit posts from banned communities \(the RAL-E dataset\). Its domain-specific linguistic knowledge was hypothesized to give it an advantage on hate speech classification. The same WeightedTrainer configuration as RoBERTa was applied.)
