/Title (This project successfully implemented the complete fine-tuning pipeline for pretrained transformer models on a multiclass hate speech detection task. All assignment requirements were met: transformer theory was presented, a public dataset was selected and described, preprocessing was justified, three transformer models were fine-tuned with documented hyperparameters, results were evaluated using Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1-score, confusion matrices and learning curves were visualized, and a comparison with a classical baseline was provided.)
