/Title (A TF-IDF vectorizer \(max 20,000 features, unigrams + bigrams, min_df=2\) combined with Logistic Regression was used as the classical baseline. Two variants were evaluated: standard and class-weighted \(class_weight='balanced'\). The balanced variant was selected as the final baseline due to its better macro F1-score.)
